## Fase 4: Integración en la Reversión (`internal/executor/executor.go`)

La función `scheduleRevert` también debe actualizarse para lanzar hooks.

**1. Actualizar `scheduleRevert`:**

```go
func scheduleRevert(
    action config.Action, 
    user string,             // NUEVO
    sourceIP net.IP, 
    params map[string]string, 
    globalHooks config.Hooks // NUEVO
) {
    // 1. Espera
    time.Sleep(time.Duration(action.RevertDelaySeconds) * time.Second)

    // 2. Ejecutar Reversión
    err := runCommand("revert", action.RevertCommand, ...)

    // 3. Preparar Contexto de Hook
    status := "success"
    errMsg := ""
    if err != nil {
        status = "error"
        errMsg = err.Error()
    }

    hCtx := HookContext{
        User: user, ActionID: "...", SourceIP: sourceIP.String(), 
        Params: params, Status: status, ErrorMsg: errMsg,
    }

    // 4. ACTION REVERT HOOK
    if action.RevertHook != "" {
        hCtx.Stage = "action_revert"
        RunHook(action.RevertHook, hCtx)
    }

    // 5. GLOBAL REVERT HOOK
    if globalHooks.OnRevert != "" {
        hCtx.Stage = "global_revert"
        RunHook(globalHooks.OnRevert, hCtx)
    }
}
```

